  "body": "## Summary\n\n`doc/2026-11-08_design_id6012_visual_feature_cost_ranking.md` defines a measured cost vector and rank table for sprites, filters, and shaders; the three gate layers and precedence; #5970-authored fallback substitution; viewer-facing downgrade reasons; and person-scoped minimum-rank exceptions. It defines only the semantic ranking inputs #6013 needs, not the shader format.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** the triage packet found no landed ranking design on main.\n- **After:** the new design record covers the #6012 scope; `git diff --check` passed.\n- Open #7019's conflicting ownership and exhausted-fallback wording remains explicitly unresolved; escalation to the #5955/#5970 owners is recorded in [the #6012 issue comment](https://github.com/developing-today/code/issues/6012#issuecomment-6728673001).\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** Two-way — this is a docs-only decision record and can be superseded by a follow-up record without changing runtime behavior.\n\n**Blast Radius:** Design-only — it informs future ranking and shader integration; this PR changes no implementation.\n\nCloses #6012",
